  "label": "Identity struggle",
  "description": "The process of navigating and understanding one’s identity, often involving conflict between societal expectations and personal authenticity. The drag performer’s external presentation is a form of identity expression, while the text describes an internal struggle with identity acceptance. This concept is central to understanding the meme’s message about self-acceptance and societal acceptance.",
